<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 2.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  McIntosh Sec	    10.23     0.88</p>
<p>2  Prime Credit Tr	 10.21     0.96</p>
<p>3  Prop Income Inv	 10.16     1.00</p>
